■ English
--------------------------------------------------

All content in this repository is the official work created by the original author.
This repository serves as the canonical (official) archive of the work.

[Permitted]
- Viewing
- Downloading
- Redistribution with proper credit attribution

[Prohibited]
- Modification of any content in this repository
- Republishing modified versions as part of this repository
- Removing or altering the author's credit

[Derivative Works]
If you wish to create derivative works or modifications,
please use the designated "remix" repository instead of this one.

